TITAN TCP PROXY — Handoff Summary
Project Overview
    Titan is a Python transparent TCP proxy with a web dashboard. 
    Real-world use: routing 20 PLC devices (Datakom D500/D509) data to Datakom cloud (rm.datakom.com.tr). Runs as a systemd service on a Debian VPS.

